          "line2": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">The VariAx 2 Clavicle Plating System provides surgeons with a comprehensive range of antomic plating options that work with a common instrument and screw platform. Plates utilize SmartLock Technology which permits polyaxial screw placement. You can angle locking screws up to 15° in each direction for a total range of 30° providing you with the flexibility to position screws based on the patient’s needs, not on the plate’s pre-existing design.</span></span>",
