          "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 22 2022 22:16:19 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Midshaft</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">A.</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">&nbsp;Increased and decreased curvature to accommodate different medial to lateral curvatures<br>\n <br>\n </span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">B.</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">&nbsp;The Bridge Plates are designed with suture holes which may be used to help reduce and hold comminuted fracture fragments</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Sat Nov 19 2022 21:56:01 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
