          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"> <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">SOMA<sup>®</sup> </span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Designed</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Only by truly understanding the challenges you face can we offer a portfolio to best fit your needs. With anatomically contoured plates designed or validated using our proprietary SOMA technology, streamlined instrumentation, and trained representatives, our plating portfolio is designed with you in mind.\u000b</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Our plating portfolio ranges from indication specific plates and patented Smartlock technology to streamlined instrumentation for ease-of-use in the OR. Helping to solve&nbsp; complicated fractures with simple innovative solutions – Plating that fits.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Stryker Orthopaedic Modeling and Analytics, or SOMA, consists of a database of over 19,500 3D bones generated from CT scans of patients. This comprehensive database and proprietary software helps design a better fitting implant and allows for true evidence based design.</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Sat Nov 19 2022 21:26:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
    "cols2_2_3_1_3_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "cedu.ocson@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "cedu.ocson@stryker.com",
