          "line2": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(237,238,236);\">Discover more about VariAx 2 Clavicle by exploring our collection of unique clinical resources including surgical reduction technique, exposure, and product overview videos, brochures, whitepapers, and more.</span></span></span>",
